                                </span>
                                <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span className="text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium tracking-[0.2em] bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-200 border border-sky-400/30">
                                        長期記憶
